@startuml
node "Docker Host / Servidor" {
    node "Network: sidis-net" {
        node "Container: aircraft-instance-1" {
            [Spring Boot App (Port 8081)] as App1
        }
        node "Container: aircraft-instance-2" {
            [Spring Boot App (Port 8082)] as App2
        }
        database "MySQL / H2 Database" as DB
    }
}

App1 --> DB : Acede a dados
App2 --> DB : Acede a dados
App1 <--> App2 : HTTP REST (Peer Forwarding)[cite: 25, 26]
@enduml